    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "annot-2a1",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 2440,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 157.5,
      "text": "AS-BUILT 2026-07-24 (Listener rail, 2A-S1): events/ gains the durable poll->enqueue runtime for\nkind:'listener' triggers. NEW events/listener-supervisor.ts (deps-injected, cancel-safe start/stop,\nunref timers, per-listener backoff, reconcile add/remove) drives NEW\nintegrations/event-sources/platform-poll.ts (provider-specific: M365 item-high-water $skip, Gmail\npoll-time pageToken, MAX_ITEMS_PER_TICK 500, first-poll=now/no-backfill). Cursors persist via NEW\nevents/listener-state.ts. It enqueues into the EXISTING events/queue.ts (no second queue); platform\npolls call integrations/ callPlatformIntegration (OAuth refresh in core). Wired ONLY in server.ts\n(configure+start post-listen, stop on shutdown). TriggerDoc/shared Trigger gain kind + pollConfig\n(absent=>webhook, migration-free).",
      "originalText": "AS-BUILT 2026-07-24 (Listener rail, 2A-S1): events/ gains the durable poll->enqueue runtime for\nkind:'listener' triggers. NEW events/listener-supervisor.ts (deps-injected, cancel-safe start/stop,\nunref timers, per-listener backoff, reconcile add/remove) drives NEW\nintegrations/event-sources/platform-poll.ts (provider-specific: M365 item-high-water $skip, Gmail\npoll-time pageToken, MAX_ITEMS_PER_TICK 500, first-poll=now/no-backfill). Cursors persist via NEW\nevents/listener-state.ts. It enqueues into the EXISTING events/queue.ts (no second queue); platform\npolls call integrations/ callPlatformIntegration (OAuth refresh in core). Wired ONLY in server.ts\n(configure+start post-listen, stop on shutdown). TriggerDoc/shared Trigger gain kind + pollConfig\n(absent=>webhook, migration-free).",
      "rawText": "AS-BUILT 2026-07-24 (Listener rail, 2A-S1): events/ gains the durable poll->enqueue runtime for\nkind:'listener' triggers. NEW events/listener-supervisor.ts (deps-injected, cancel-safe start/stop,\nunref timers, per-listener backoff, reconcile add/remove) drives NEW\nintegrations/event-sources/platform-poll.ts (provider-specific: M365 item-high-water $skip, Gmail\npoll-time pageToken, MAX_ITEMS_PER_TICK 500, first-poll=now/no-backfill). Cursors persist via NEW\nevents/listener-state.ts. It enqueues into the EXISTING events/queue.ts (no second queue); platform\npolls call integrations/ callPlatformIntegration (OAuth refresh in core). Wired ONLY in server.ts\n(configure+start post-listen, stop on shutdown). TriggerDoc/shared Trigger gain kind + pollConfig\n(absent=>webhook, migration-free).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#b45309",
